; NES note constants
; Pulse/Triangle NOTE_* indices = 1..73 (C1..C7)
; Noise NOISE_PERIOD_* indices = 80..95
; NOTE_REST = $7F (NOT $00) so the player can distinguish a REST entry
; (`NOTE_REST, $01`) from the end-of-stream sentinel ($00). Keep this
; non-zero if regenerating; the player relies on $00 == end-of-stream.

